# Build-context excludes for docker/gheit-dev/Dockerfile.eks.
#
# BuildKit prefers <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the repo-root .dockerignore,
# so this file shadows the root one for the EKS build only.
#
# Identical to the root .dockerignore EXCEPT that `vendor` is NOT excluded:
# the neocarex-dev buildspec stages a pre-resolved vendor/ bundle from S3 into
# the build context, and Dockerfile.eks COPYs it into the image. Excluding it
# here makes the build fail with `"/vendor": not found`.
.git
.github
.phpstan
ci
Documentation
tests
docker/**/docker_data
docker/**/.env
node_modules
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
